 "notes": "Addresses name the island (UPU), but ISO 3166-2:BS has 31 districts. Where one ISO district is the whole island its code is used. Non-ISO codes are kept only for islands split across several ISO districts: Abaco (BS-NO, CO, SO, HT, GC, MI), Andros (BS-NS, CS, SA, MC), Eleuthera (BS-NE, CE, SE), Grand Bahama (BS-FP, EG, WG). Black Point (BS-BP) is part of Exuma. BS-CROOKED_ISLAND -> BS-CK (ISO district \"Crooked Island and Long Cay\" covers the island). Island list taken over from subdivisions.tsv/Google live; not re-checked against a current Bahamas Post list (none found online)."
